An open implementation of Discord's local RPC servers

Allowing RPC where it was otherwise impossible, like Discord Web and custom
clients

arRPC is an open source implementation of Discord's half-documented local RPC
servers for their desktop client. This open source implementation purely in
NodeJS allows it to be used in many places where it is otherwise impossible to
do: Discord web and alternative clients like ArmCord/etc. It opens a simple
bridge WebSocket server which messages the JSON of exactly what to dispatch
with in the client with no extra processing needed, allowing small and simple
mods or plugins. arRPC is experimental and a work in progress, so expect bugs,
etc.
